  "question": {
    "text": "Let<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8469;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8469;</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>144</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />The <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "27",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>144</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>where&#160;</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#8712;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>N</mi></math></p><p>On rearranging we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>where&#160;</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>where&#160;</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math></p><p>Now let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>Y</mi></math></p><p>So, new equation and domain will become,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>Y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>Y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now on plotting the diagram we get,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7fca8e37-d5c8-4063-b896-8c47900c8b0d-image.png\" style=\"width: 346px; height: 220px;\" /></p><p>Now number of point in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will be given by,</p><p>Take&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;and check for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi></math></p><p>So, possible for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>T</mi></math>&nbsp;will be,</p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>possible&#160;case</mtext></math></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>possible&#160;case</mtext></math></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>possible&#160;case</mtext></math></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>possible&#160;case</mtext></math></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>possible&#160;case</mtext></math></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mtext>Total&#160;</mtext><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>possible&#160;case</mtext></math></p><p>So, total cases will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
